  "Software Details": "Detalles del programa",
  "The Donation Module of eCommerceGo SaaS empowers businesses to make a positive difference by integrating charitable giving into their online platforms. This module enables businesses to align their brand values with social responsibility initiatives, fostering goodwill and making a meaningful impact on causes that matter. By providing customers with the option to donate during the checkout process, businesses can leverage their e-commerce presence to support charitable organizations and contribute to positive social change.": "El módulo de donaciones de eCommerceGo SaaS permite a las empresas marcar una diferencia positiva integrando donaciones caritativas en sus plataformas en línea. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Ver demostración en vivo",
  "Foster Social Impact Through Online Giving": "Fomentar el impacto social a través de donaciones en línea",
  "The Donation module of eCommerceGo SaaS empowers businesses to seamlessly integrate charitable giving into their online platforms, fostering goodwill and social impact with ease.": "El módulo de donaciones de eCommerceGo SaaS permite a las empresas integrar perfectamente las donaciones caritativas en sus plataformas en línea, fomentando la buena voluntad y el impacto social con facilidad.",
  "Seamless Integration for Giving Back": "Integración perfecta para retribuir",
  "With the Donation Module, businesses can seamlessly integrate donation options into their checkout flow, providing customers with an effortless way to give back. By incorporating donation prompts at strategic points during the purchasing journey, businesses can raise awareness about important causes and inspire customers to contribute. This frictionless approach to online giving enhances the overall customer experience and demonstrates a commitment to corporate social responsibility.": "Con el Módulo de donación, las empresas pueden integrar fácilmente opciones de donación en su flujo de pago, brindando a los clientes una forma sencilla de retribuir. ",
  "Amplify Brand Reputation and Trust": "Amplifique la reputación y la confianza de la marca",
  "Supporting charitable causes through the Donation Module not only benefits those in need but also enhances a business brand reputation and trustworthiness. Customers are increasingly drawn to socially conscious brands that prioritize giving back to the community. By showcasing their commitment to philanthropy, businesses can differentiate themselves from competitors and build stronger connections with their audience, fostering loyalty and positive brand associations.": "Apoyar causas benéficas a través del Módulo de donaciones no solo beneficia a quienes lo necesitan, sino que también mejora la reputación y la confiabilidad de la marca comercial. ",
